  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UK Contribution to Trust Fund for Victims</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UK Contributions to the International Criminal Courts (ICC) Trust Fund for Victims (TFV) in accordance with 1998&#x2019;s Rome Statute. It forms a crucial pillar of the ICC&#x2019;s victim-centred approach, providing physical, psychological, and material support to victims and their families for harms resulting from crimes under the ICC&#x2019;s jurisdiction.</narrative>
  </description>
